powerpagecomponent.content:
{
  "description": "Exposes al_questionversion to the portal Web API so an unsubmitted review page can re-read its own checklist live (2026-09-21). Power Pages renders from a server-side cache that learns about a Dataverse write through polled change tracking, so a question retyped in the Code App could leave the form drawing the previous scale for up to fifteen minutes (AD-094, AD-117); the Web API is not that cache. READ ONLY in effect: the 'Question Version - read' table permission grants read alone, and the Web API cannot exceed a table permission, so enabling this adds no way to alter the checklist from a browser.",
  "value": "true"
}
